From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] build: accept Autoconf 2.71

The configure input uses no feature that requires Autoconf 2.72.  Accept the
2.71 release provided by openEuler 24.03 LTS SP3 so the GitHub tag snapshot,
which does not contain a generated configure script, can be regenerated.

---
 configure.ac | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index 8136366..ed3f46c 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # Process this file with autoconf to create configure.
 
-AC_PREREQ([2.72])
+AC_PREREQ([2.71])
 
 # ====================
 # Version informations
-- 
2.51.0
